flowchart TD
    A[Start sync run: Contacts change or app launch] --> B{Second instance fingerprint?}
    B -- yes --> Z1[Fail closed]
    B -- no --> C[Load Application Support snapshot]
    C --> D[Read Contacts and Sheet]
    D --> E[Match CNContact.identifier and cw- IDs]
    E --> F{cw_id missing, duplicate, or rewritten?}
    F -- yes --> Z2[Fail closed]
    F -- no --> G[Process each field atom]
    G --> H[Compare Contacts and Sheet with last-successfully-applied ancestor]
    H --> I{Three-way result}
    I -- one side changed --> J[Propagate changed side]
    I -- equal --> K[Advance ancestor]
    I -- genuine conflict --> L[Freeze field and write header-named cw_conflict]
    L --> M[No auto-winner]
    M --> W{New human write in Contacts.app?}
    W -- no --> X[Remain frozen]
    W -- yes --> Y[Propagate live Contacts value to Sheet]
    Y --> Y1{Sheet write succeeds?}
    Y1 -- no --> X
    Y1 -- yes --> Y2[Clear cw_conflict and advance ancestor]
    J --> N[Apply groups, membership, and photo hash/presence rules]
    K --> N
    X --> N
    Y2 --> N
    N --> O[Apply deterministic additive-header rules]
    O --> P{Size bound overflow?}
    P -- yes --> Z3[Fail closed]
    P -- no --> Q[Persist result and ancestor]
    Q --> R{Both absent for 3 successful runs?}
    R -- yes --> S[Garbage-collect tombstone]
    R -- no --> T[Retain tombstone]
    S --> U[Same inputs yield same result]
    T --> U
    U --> V[Contacts.app remains the human UI]
